<%- include('includes/header') %>
<section class="page-top"><div class="wrap"><h1>About <%= store %></h1><p>A small bookstore with a big love for reading.</p></div></section>
<main class="wrap section-tight about">
    <div class="box">
        <h2>Our story</h2>
        <figure class="about-visual">
            <img src="/banners/hero.svg" alt="A welcoming stack of books with a cup of tea and a leafy plant">
            <figcaption>A little inspiration for your next reading adventure.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p><%= store %> began with a simple idea: finding your next good read should feel as enjoyable as opening a new book. We bring stories, practical ideas and helpful guides together in one easy-to-browse shop.</p>
        <p>Whether you are discovering a new author, returning to a favourite genre or choosing a thoughtful gift, we want it to be simple to explore the shelves and find something that feels right for you.</p>
        <p>Browse by category, read each book's details, and add your favourites to the cart whenever you are ready. We offer cash on delivery, so you can pay when your books arrive.</p>
        <p>We are always happy to hear from readers. If you have a question about a book or need help with an order, visit our contact page and send us a message.</p>
        <p><a class="btn btn-buy" href="/books">Shop books</a> <a class="btn btn-line" href="/contact">Talk to us</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-side">
        <div class="box"><span class="big-ico">📖</span><h3>Something for every reader</h3><p>Explore the books by category and discover stories, fresh perspectives and useful ideas at your own pace.</p></div>
        <div class="box"><span class="big-ico">🛒</span><h3>Easy to explore and order</h3><p>Check the book details, choose your favourites and place your order through a simple shopping experience.</p></div>
        <div class="box"><span class="big-ico">💵</span><h3>Pay on delivery</h3><p>There is no online payment at checkout. Pay in cash when your books are delivered.</p></div>
        <div class="box"><span class="big-ico">💬</span><h3>Here to help</h3><p>Have a question about a book or your order? Send us a message through the contact page.</p></div>
    </div>
</main>
<%- include('includes/footer') %>
